OL,3,AUS flights allowed to take off again as
OL,4,Anationwide ground stop lifted but
OL,5,Adelays expected
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy
OL,8,Fsays a nationwide ground stop has been
OL,9,Flifted after an outage halted all
OL,10,Fflights
OL,12,FDuffy says the travel chaos is going to
OL,13,Ftake time to unwind, with many
OL,14,Fpassengers still stranded at airports
OL,16,FWhite House officials said earlier the
OL,17,Fground stop was due to an air traffic
OL,18,Fcontrol communications issue - here's
OL,19,Fwhat we know so far
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
