OL,6,
OL,7,FThere's zero evidence this was a
OL,8,Fcyber-attack against the US, Homeland
OL,9,FSecurity Secretary Markwayne Mullin
OL,10,Fsays - what else did he say?
OL,12,FThe incident was the largest groundstop
OL,13,Fin the US since the one after 11
OL,14,FSeptember 2001
OL,16,FUS bound flights from across Europe
OL,17,Fwere suspended after a Federal Aviation
OL,18,FAdministration request
